                <num>30</num>
                <heading>Paragraph 55A(4)(a)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-30__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-30__qstr-1__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>relates to an investigation relating to a relevant crime in so far as the relevant crime is an offence against a law of the State (irrespective of whether that offence has a federal aspect); and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                </quotedStructure>
              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-31">
