              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-34">
                <num>34</num>
                <heading>Subsection 55A(14) (definition of intelligence operation)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Omit “criminal activity”, substitute “crime”.</p>
                </content>
              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-35">
                <num>35</num>
